&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8742&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;Experience working in a distributed team across multiple timezones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8812&quot;&gt;You have a BS in Information Systems, Computer Engineering, Management, or similar relevant field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8812&quot;&gt;Strong interest in cybersecurity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone actively leveraging AI tools in their current work, with an informed perspective on how AI impacts team delivery, productivity, and engineering quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
