&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;our wins – big and small.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/careers/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We are seeking a Senior Platform Enablement / DevOps Engineer to lead the design, scalability, reliability, and evolution of our enterprise developer platform and cloud-native delivery ecosystem.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role combines deep technical expertise with platform strategy, operational leadership, and engineering enablement. You will help define standards, modernize deployment practices, improve developer experience, and drive platform reliability across multi-cloud environments.&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate has strong experience building enterprise-scale CI/CD platforms, Kubernetes ecosystems, Infrastructure as Code, observability solutions, and developer enablement capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, build, and evolve scalable platform engineering and DevOps solutions for enterprise engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of modern CI/CD and GitOps workflows using Jenkins, Kargo, ArgoCD, GitHub, and related tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive platform standardization, automation, reliability, and self-service engineering capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage scalable Infrastructure as Code frameworks using Terraform and Terraform Enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Kubernetes platform architecture, Helm-based deployments, and container orchestration best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish observability standards and operational excellence using Grafana, Loki, Prometheus, OpenTelemetry, and related tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering, security, cloud, and architecture teams to improve platform capabilities and developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and contribute to platform engineering best practices, governance, and technical strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead incident response, reliability improvements, root cause analysis, and operational maturity initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve platform security, scalability, resiliency, and deployment efficiency across AWS, Azure, and GCP environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and introduce new technologies, tooling, and automation opportunities aligned with platform engineering goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in Platform Engineering, DevOps, SRE, Cloud Engineering, or related roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in designing and operating enterprise-scale CI/CD and cloud-native platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on experience with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jenkins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kargo / ArgoCD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Terraform / Terraform Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes &amp;amp; Helm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with multi-cloud infrastructure:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS, Azure, and/or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of observability ecosystems including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grafana&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loki&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prometheus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OpenTelemetry tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong scripting/programming experience with Python, Kotlin, Bash, or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with build and dependency tooling such as Gradle, Poetry, and UV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Linux internals, networking, distributed systems, and platform reliability engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving platform modernization and developer enablement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, collaboration, and technical leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal developer platforms (IDP) at enterprise scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with platform governance, security, secrets management, and compliance integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to event-driven platform architectures and scalable distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring teams and influencing engineering standards across organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of modern platform engineering trends, GitOps practices, and cloud-native ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Work With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jenkins, Kargo, ArgoCD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Terraform &amp;amp; Terraform Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker, Kubernetes, Helm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS, Azure, GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grafana, Loki, Prometheus, OpenTelemetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, Kotlin, Gradle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UV, Poetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux &amp;amp; Networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anaplan does not: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend offers to candidates without an extensive interview process with a member of our recruitment team and a hiring manager via video or in person.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send job offers via email. All offers are first extended verbally by a member of our internal recruitment team whenever possible and then followed up via written communication. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All emails from Anaplan would come from an ----- email address. Should you have any doubts about the authenticity of an email, letter or telephone communication purportedly from, for, or on behalf of Anaplan, please send an email to ----- before taking any further action in relation to the correspondence.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;andidate data processed during our recruitment activities is handled &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;in accordance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our Candidate Privacy Notice. This may include the use of artificial intelligence or automated tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;assist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our team in evaluating qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At DistroKid, we help artists share their music with the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Salary varies by country and market. &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UK and EU salary ranges are posted below. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For candidates in Latin America, it will be discussed during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:**&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The listed salary ranges reflect Senior-level compensation. Staff-level candidates may be eligible for compensation above the published ranges based on experience and qualifications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Not available. We cannot sponsor visas, work permits, or extensions in any country (including OPT/CPT, PGWP, Graduate Route, or similar programs).&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Employment Type: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Full-time employee (no B2Bs/contracts, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a&lt;strong&gt; Growth Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; (Senior to Staff level) to help us achieve our big vision that everyone who makes music has a DistroKid account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DistroKid, our product and marketing funnels evolved in parallel. This role unites them and owns the whole picture: member growth end to end, from how artists find us through to how they get value and stay for the long haul. You&#39;ll establish where the leverage is, back it with data, and ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with our staff marketing engineer to direct a small, diligent cross-functional team, and work with them while working across product, marketing, data, and design. This role reports into product and treats marketing as an equal partner in setting priorities. You&#39;ll shape a single growth backlog, balancing measurable wins against the longer-term bets worth protecting. You&#39;ll build the framework that sizes every growth opportunity on the same terms, so prioritization performs on evidence and expected impact. Ideas and market intelligence come from across the company; you turn the greatest of them into instrumented experiments tied to the product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Own member growth and the prioritized backlog that moves it, and build the measurement framework the company uses to size and evaluate growth bets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Navigate the full funnel to achieve our growth goals, including acquisition, onboarding, activation, retention, reactivation, and referrals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Conduct experiments end to end: hypothesis, instrumentation, analysis, iteration, and knowing when to stop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Use AI tooling to compress the loop from idea to shipped experiment, multiplying what a small, nimble team can ship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Keep the executive team clear on what you&#39;re doing, why, and what you&#39;re trading off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Learn from the top consumer growth teams and bring back what works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Help PMs and marketers across the company surface and clear their own growth blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Use and iterate on the artist tools and promo assets we already have to build organic and viral growth loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in product or growth, with 3+ years owning a subscriber, revenue, or retention KPI at a scaled consumer or self-serve software company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You conduct experiments at scale, pull your own data, and know the difference between a real result and noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve used AI tools to get real growth or productivity gains, not just experimented with them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a knack for taking rough, half-formed ideas and turning them into plans a team is excited to perform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You form a clear view of where the opportunity is and change it when the data tells you to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You make complicated things simple and explain them well, including the trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It&#39;s a bonus (but not required) to have:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;familiarity with lifecycle and martech tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience designing and enhancing personalized surfaces (and a clear sense of when personalization earns its complexity and when it doesn&#39;t)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Work With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated growth team including engineering, data, and design support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reporting line into product, and marketing as a co-owner of the growth backlog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High traffic volume and a product millions of artists already love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company that values speed, creativity, and clear thinking&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
