&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer Ordering Experience&lt;/strong&gt; owns the core purchase journey: the store page, item page, basket, and checkout flow, across both app and web. It&#39;s a global team — the surfaces we build support all of our brands: Deliveroo, Wolt, and Doordash. You&#39;d be the team&#39;s first dedicated web/full-stack engineer, helping us build out our web experience from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
